flowchart TD
    Start([User Clicks Refresh]) --> ValidateUI[Validate UI Selections<br/>1. SelectedFilterNames<br/>2. SelectedMepCategories<br/>3. SelectedReferenceFiles<br/>4. SelectedHostFiles<br/>5. SelectedHostCategories]
    ValidateUI -->|Invalid| Cancel([Cancel Refresh])
    ValidateUI -->|Valid| CheckFilterDB{Check Filter in Database<br/>TABLE: Filters<br/>QUERY: SELECT FilterId FROM Filters<br/>WHERE FilterName = @FilterName<br/>AND Category = @Category}
    
    CheckFilterDB -->|Filter EXISTS| LoadFilter["Load Filter from Database<br/>TABLE: Filters<br/>QUERY: SELECT FilterId, FilterName, Category, SelectedHostCategories, OpeningSettings FROM Filters WHERE FilterId = @FilterId<br/>RETURNS: FilterId INTEGER, FilterName TEXT, Category TEXT, SelectedHostCategories TEXT JSON, OpeningSettings TEXT JSON"]
    
    CheckFilterDB -->|Filter NOT FOUND<br/>No FilterId| ValidateFilter{Validate Filter<br/>- UI Selections Valid ✓<br/>- Filter Name Not Empty<br/>- Category Valid}
    
    ValidateFilter -->|Invalid| Cancel
    ValidateFilter -->|Valid| CreateFilter["Create Filter in Database<br/>TABLE: Filters<br/>INSERT INTO Filters (FilterName, Category, IsFilterComboNew, CreatedAt, UpdatedAt) VALUES (@FilterName, @Category, 0, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)<br/>POPULATES: FilterId AUTO-GENERATED, FilterName from UI, Category from UI, IsFilterComboNew=0, CreatedAt NOW, UpdatedAt NOW"]
    
    CreateFilter --> CheckCreateFilter{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckCreateFilter -->|Failed| RollbackCreateFilter[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: Filter Creation Failed]
    RollbackCreateFilter --> Cancel
    CheckCreateFilter -->|Success| SaveUIState["Save UI State to Database<br/>TABLE: Filters<br/>UPDATE Filters SET SelectedHostCategories = @SelectedHostCategories, OpeningSettings = @OpeningSettings, UpdatedAt = CURRENT_TIMESTAMP WHERE FilterId = @FilterId<br/>POPULATES: SelectedHostCategories JSON array, OpeningSettings JSON object"]
    
    SaveUIState --> CheckSaveUIState{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckSaveUIState -->|Failed| RollbackSaveUIState[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: UI State Save Failed]
    RollbackSaveUIState --> Cancel
    CheckSaveUIState -->|Success| CheckFileComboDB
    
    LoadFilter --> CheckLoadFilter{Database<br/>Load<br/>Success?}
    CheckLoadFilter -->|Failed| LogLoadFilterError[Log Error: Filter Load Failed<br/>Fallback to XML or Cancel]
    LogLoadFilterError --> Cancel
    CheckLoadFilter -->|Success| CheckFileComboDB{Check FileCombo in Database<br/>TABLE: FileCombos<br/>QUERY: SELECT ComboId, IsFilterComboNew<br/>FROM FileCombos<br/>WHERE FilterId = @FilterId<br/>AND LinkedFileKey = @LinkedFileKey<br/>AND HostFileKey = @HostFileKey}
    
    SaveUIState --> CheckFileComboDB
    
    CheckFileComboDB -->|FileCombo EXISTS| LoadFileCombo["Load FileCombo from Database<br/>TABLE: FileCombos<br/>SELECT ComboId, IsFilterComboNew FROM FileCombos WHERE ComboId = @ComboId<br/>RETURNS: ComboId INTEGER, IsFilterComboNew 0 or 1"]
    
    CheckFileComboDB -->|FileCombo NOT FOUND| CreateFileCombo["Create FileCombo in Database<br/>TABLE: FileCombos<br/>INSERT INTO FileCombos (FilterId, LinkedFileKey, HostFileKey, IsFilterComboNew, ProcessedAt, CreatedAt, UpdatedAt) VALUES (@FilterId, @LinkedFileKey, @HostFileKey, 1, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP, CURRENT_TIMESTAMP)<br/>POPULATES: ComboId AUTO-GENERATED, FilterId from Filter, LinkedFileKey normalized, HostFileKey normalized, IsFilterComboNew=1 NEW, ProcessedAt NOW, CreatedAt NOW, UpdatedAt NOW"]
    
    CreateFileCombo --> CheckCreateFileCombo{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckCreateFileCombo -->|Failed| RollbackCreateFileCombo[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: FileCombo Creation Failed]
    RollbackCreateFileCombo --> Cancel
    CheckCreateFileCombo -->|Success| CheckFileComboFlag{Check IsFilterComboNew<br/>Flag Value<br/>From Loaded FileCombo<br/>Value: 0 or 1}
    
    LoadFileCombo --> CheckFileComboFlag
    
    CheckFileComboFlag --> CheckAdopt{Adopt to Modified<br/>Document?<br/>EnableThreePointValidation}
    
    CheckAdopt -->|OFF| CheckFileComboValue{IsFilterComboNew<br/>= 0?}
    CheckAdopt -->|ON| CheckExisting{Filter has<br/>existing zones?}
    
    CheckFileComboValue -->|Yes| PATH1[PATH 1: REPLAY MODE]
    CheckFileComboValue -->|No| PATH2[PATH 2: FRESH PLACEMENT<br/>Flag = 1, New FileCombo]
    
    CheckExisting -->|No| PATH2
    CheckExisting -->|Yes| PATH3[PATH 3: FULL DETECTION<br/>WITH VALIDATION]
    
    PATH1 --> LoadExisting1[Load Existing Clash Zones<br/>from Database PRIMARY<br/>or XML Fallback]
    LoadExisting1 --> CheckLoadExisting1{Data Load<br/>Success?}
    CheckLoadExisting1 -->|Failed| LogLoadExistingError[Log Error: No Zones Found<br/>Fallback to XML or Cancel]
    LogLoadExistingError --> Cancel
    CheckLoadExisting1 -->|Success| SkipDetection1[Skip Intersection Detection]
    SkipDetection1 --> ResetFlags1[Reset Flags for<br/>Deleted Sleeves]
    ResetFlags1 --> NoSave1[No Database Save]
    NoSave1 --> PlaceSleeves1[Place Sleeves<br/>for Deleted Only]
    PlaceSleeves1 --> End1([End: PATH 1])
    
    PATH2 --> LoadXML2[Load XML Cache Once<br/>OPTIONAL - Fallback Only]
    LoadXML2 --> RunDetection2[Run Intersection Detection]
    RunDetection2 --> SkipValidation2[Skip 3-Point Validation]
    SkipValidation2 --> CreateZones2[Create Clash Zones]
    CreateZones2 --> SaveDB2["Save to Database<br/>- INSERT ClashZones all new zones<br/>- INSERT SleeveSnapshots all new<br/>NOTE: FileCombo already created<br/>with IsFilterComboNew=1"]
    SaveDB2 --> CheckSaveDB2{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckSaveDB2 -->|Failed| RollbackSaveDB2[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: ClashZones Save Failed]
    RollbackSaveDB2 --> Cancel
    CheckSaveDB2 -->|Success| Commit2[Commit Transaction]
    Commit2 --> CheckCommit2{Transaction<br/>Commit<br/>Success?}
    CheckCommit2 -->|Failed| RollbackCommit2[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: Transaction Commit Failed]
    RollbackCommit2 --> Cancel
    CheckCommit2 -->|Success| End2([End: PATH 2])
    
    PATH3 --> LoadXML3[Load XML Cache Once<br/>OPTIONAL - Fallback Only]
    LoadXML3 --> RunDetection3[Run Intersection Detection]
    RunDetection3 --> Validate3[3-Point Validation<br/>- MEP Element Exists?<br/>- Structural Element Exists?<br/>- Elements Still Intersect?]
    
    Validate3 --> SplitZones[Split Zones by Validation Result<br/>For Each Existing Zone:<br/>- MEP Element Exists? → Validated<br/>- Structural Element Exists? → Validated<br/>- Elements Still Intersect? → Validated<br/>- Any Point Fails → Invalidated<br/>- Not in Existing → New]
    
    SplitZones --> ValidatedZones[Validated Zones<br/>All 3 Points Pass]
    SplitZones --> InvalidatedZones[Invalidated Zones<br/>Any Point Fails]
    SplitZones --> NewZones[New Zones<br/>Not in Existing]
    
    ValidatedZones -->|→ PATH 1 Placement Logic| LoadZonesPlace1
    InvalidatedZones --> MergeRequired[MERGE REQUIRED<br/>- Update Intersection Points<br/>- Handle Moved Elements<br/>- Structural Updates Allowed]
    MergeRequired --> MergeZones[Merge with New Zones]
    MergeZones --> SaveInvalidated[Save Invalidated Zones<br/>to Database<br/>With Updated Geometry]
    SaveInvalidated --> CheckSaveInvalidated{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckSaveInvalidated -->|Failed| RollbackSaveInvalidated[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: Invalidated Zones Save Failed]
    RollbackSaveInvalidated --> Cancel
    CheckSaveInvalidated -->|Success| Commit3[Commit Transaction]
    Commit3 --> CheckCommit3{Transaction<br/>Commit<br/>Success?}
    CheckCommit3 -->|Failed| RollbackCommit3[Rollback Transaction<br/>Log Error: Transaction Commit Failed]
    RollbackCommit3 --> Cancel
    CheckCommit3 -->|Success| LoadConditions3[Load Conditions from Database<br/>TABLE: Filters<br/>SELECT OpeningSettings<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    
    LoadConditions3 --> CheckLoadConditions3{Database<br/>Load<br/>Success?}
    CheckLoadConditions3 -->|Failed| LogLoadConditionsError3[Log Error: Conditions Load Failed<br/>Use Default Settings or Cancel]
    LogLoadConditionsError3 --> Cancel
    CheckLoadConditions3 -->|Success| RunDetection3Invalidated
    
    NewZones -->|→ PATH 2 Placement Logic| LoadConditions2
    
    %% Placement Flow
    End1 --> PlacementFlow[Placement Flow]
    End2 --> PlacementFlow
    
    PlacementFlow --> CheckPlacementPath{Determine Placement<br/>Path<br/>Check IsFilterComboNew Flag}
    
    CheckPlacementPath -->|IsFilterComboNew=0| LoadUISettings[Load Current UI Settings<br/>OpeningSettings from UI State]
    CheckPlacementPath -->|IsFilterComboNew=1| SizingPath[PATH 2: SIZING<br/>Calculate Sleeve Sizes]
    
    LoadUISettings --> LoadDBSettings[Load DB Settings<br/>SELECT OpeningSettings FROM Filters<br/>WHERE FilterId = @FilterId]
    LoadDBSettings --> CheckLoadDBSettings{Database<br/>Load<br/>Success?}
    CheckLoadDBSettings -->|Failed| LogLoadDBError[Log Error: DB Settings Load Failed<br/>Assume Conditions Changed]
    LogLoadDBError --> SizingPath
    CheckLoadDBSettings -->|Success| CheckConditionsChanged{Conditions Changed?<br/>Compare UI OpeningSettings<br/>with DB OpeningSettings<br/>PATH 1}
    
    CheckConditionsChanged -->|Conditions Changed| SizingPath
    CheckConditionsChanged -->|Conditions NOT Changed| ReplayPath[PATH 1: REPLAY<br/>Use Saved Data from DB]
    
    %% PATH 3 Placement - Direct Routing (No Flag Check)
    %% Validated zones already routed to LoadZonesPlace1 above
    %% Invalidated/New zones already routed to LoadConditions2 above
    
    %% PATH 1: REPLAY - Distinct Flow
    ReplayPath --> LoadZonesPlace1[Load Clash Zones<br/>from Database]
    LoadZonesPlace1 --> SyncFlags1[Sync Flags from Database<br/>PRIMARY or Global XML Fallback]
    SyncFlags1 --> LoopZones1{For Each<br/>Clash Zone}
    
    LoopZones1 --> CheckSleeve1{Sleeve Exists?<br/>MEP+Host+Point}
    CheckSleeve1 -->|Yes| Skip1[SKIP - Sleeve Already Exists]
    CheckSleeve1 -->|No| PlaceSleeve1[Place Sleeve<br/>Using Saved Data from DB]
    
    PlaceSleeve1 --> CheckPlaceSleeve1{Sleeve<br/>Placement<br/>Success?}
    CheckPlaceSleeve1 -->|Failed| LogPlaceError1[Log Error: Sleeve Placement Failed<br/>Continue with Next Zone]
    LogPlaceError1 --> LoopZones1
    CheckPlaceSleeve1 -->|Success| UpdateFlags1[Update Flags in Database<br/>PRIMARY and Global XML Fallback<br/>- IsResolved = true<br/>- SleeveInstanceId]
    
    UpdateFlags1 --> CheckUpdateFlags1{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckUpdateFlags1 -->|Failed| LogFlagError1[Log Error: Flag Update Failed<br/>Continue with Next Zone]
    LogFlagError1 --> LoopZones1
    CheckUpdateFlags1 -->|Success| LoopZones1
    
    Skip1 --> LoopZones1
    
    LoopZones1 -->|All Individual<br/>Sleeves Placed| CheckClusterData1{Check ClusterSleeves Table<br/>Cluster data exists<br/>for ComboId?<br/>PATH 1}
    
    CheckClusterData1 -->|Cluster Data EXISTS| LoadClusterData1[Load Cluster Data<br/>from Database<br/>PATH 1<br/>NO CALCULATION]
    CheckClusterData1 -->|No Cluster Data| SkipClustering1[Skip Clustering<br/>No Data Available<br/>PATH 1]
    
    LoadClusterData1 --> PlaceCluster1[Place Cluster Sleeves<br/>Using Stored Data from DB<br/>PATH 1]
    PlaceCluster1 --> DeleteIndividual1[Delete Individual Sleeves<br/>within Clusters<br/>PATH 1]
    DeleteIndividual1 --> UpdateClusterFlags1[Update Flags in Database<br/>- IsClusterResolved = true<br/>- ClusterSleeveInstanceId<br/>- Clear SleeveInstanceId<br/>PATH 1]
    
    SkipClustering1 --> UpdateClusterFlags1
    
    %% PATH 3 Validated Zones - After PATH 1 Placement
    %% Validated zones use PATH 1 placement, but always recalculate clusters
    %% (nearby zone changes may affect cluster formation)
    UpdateFlags1 --> CheckValidatedFromPath3{Validated Zones<br/>from PATH 3?}
    CheckValidatedFromPath3 -->|Yes PATH 3 Validated| AlwaysCluster3Validated[Always Run Clustering<br/>Recalculation<br/>PATH 3 Validated<br/>Nearby zones may have changed]
    CheckValidatedFromPath3 -->|No PATH 1 Only| UpdateClusterFlags1
    
    %% PATH 3 Validated Zones Clustering - Always Calculate
    AlwaysCluster3Validated --> ClusterFlow3Validated[Cluster Flow - Calculation<br/>PATH 3 Validated<br/>FRESH CALCULATION]
    ClusterFlow3Validated --> LoadClusterZones3Validated[Load Clash Zones from DB<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    LoadClusterZones3Validated --> GroupSleeves3Validated[Group Sleeves<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    GroupSleeves3Validated --> CalculateProximity3Validated[Calculate Proximity<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    CalculateProximity3Validated --> FormClusters3Validated[Form Clusters<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    FormClusters3Validated --> CheckRotation3Validated{Need Rotated<br/>Bounding Box?<br/>PATH 3 Validated}
    CheckRotation3Validated -->|Axis-Aligned| AxisAligned3Validated[Calculate Axis-Aligned<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    CheckRotation3Validated -->|Rotated| Rotated3Validated[Calculate Rotated<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    AxisAligned3Validated --> CalculateClusterData3Validated[Calculate Cluster Data<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    Rotated3Validated --> CalculateClusterData3Validated
    CalculateClusterData3Validated --> SaveClusterData3Validated[Save Cluster Data<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    SaveClusterData3Validated --> PlaceClusterCalc3Validated[Place Cluster Sleeves<br/>Using Calculated Data<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    PlaceClusterCalc3Validated --> DeleteIndividual3Validated[Delete Individual Sleeves<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    DeleteIndividual3Validated --> UpdateClusterFlags3Validated[Update Flags in Database<br/>PATH 3 Validated]
    UpdateClusterFlags3Validated --> ResetFlagAfterCluster
    
    %% PATH 2: SIZING - Distinct Flow
    SizingPath --> LoadConditions2[Load Conditions from Database<br/>TABLE: Filters<br/>SELECT OpeningSettings<br/>WHERE FilterId = @FilterId<br/>Contains: ClearanceSettings JSON]
    LoadConditions2 --> CheckLoadConditions2{Database<br/>Load<br/>Success?}
    CheckLoadConditions2 -->|Failed| LogLoadConditionsError2[Log Error: Conditions Load Failed<br/>Use Default Settings or Cancel]
    LogLoadConditionsError2 --> Cancel
    CheckLoadConditions2 -->|Success| CalculateSize[Calculate Sleeve Size<br/>- Read Clearance Settings from DB<br/>- Read Conditions from DB<br/>- Apply Clearance to MEP Dimensions]
    CalculateSize --> PlaceSleeve2[Place Sleeve<br/>With Calculated Size<br/>No Flag Management]
    PlaceSleeve2 --> CheckPlaceSleeve2{Sleeve<br/>Placement<br/>Success?}
    CheckPlaceSleeve2 -->|Failed| LogPlaceError2[Log Error: Sleeve Placement Failed<br/>Continue with Next Zone]
    LogPlaceError2 --> CheckNewFromPath3
    CheckPlaceSleeve2 -->|Success| UpdateFlags2[Update Flags in Database<br/>- IsResolved = true<br/>- SleeveInstanceId<br/>PATH 2<br/>NOTE: FileCombo flag stays = 1<br/>Reset AFTER clustering]
    
    UpdateFlags2 --> CheckUpdateFlags2{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckUpdateFlags2 -->|Failed| LogFlagError2[Log Error: Flag Update Failed<br/>Continue with Next Zone]
    LogFlagError2 --> CheckNewFromPath3
    CheckUpdateFlags2 -->|Success| CheckNewFromPath3{New Zones<br/>from PATH 3?}
    CheckNewFromPath3 -->|Yes PATH 3 New| AlwaysCluster3New[Always Run Clustering<br/>Calculation<br/>PATH 3 New]
    CheckNewFromPath3 -->|No PATH 2 Only| AlwaysCluster2[Always Run Clustering<br/>Calculation<br/>PATH 2]
    
    AlwaysCluster2 --> ClusterFlow2[Cluster Flow - Calculation<br/>PATH 2<br/>FRESH CALCULATION]
    
    %% PATH 3 New Zones Clustering
    AlwaysCluster3New --> ClusterFlow3New[Cluster Flow - Calculation<br/>PATH 3 New<br/>FRESH CALCULATION]
    ClusterFlow3New --> LoadClusterZones3New[Load Clash Zones from DB<br/>PATH 3 New]
    LoadClusterZones3New --> GroupSleeves3New[Group Sleeves<br/>PATH 3 New]
    GroupSleeves3New --> CalculateProximity3New[Calculate Proximity<br/>PATH 3 New]
    CalculateProximity3New --> FormClusters3New[Form Clusters<br/>PATH 3 New]
    FormClusters3New --> CheckRotation3New{Need Rotated<br/>Bounding Box?<br/>PATH 3 New}
    CheckRotation3New -->|Axis-Aligned| AxisAligned3New[Calculate Axis-Aligned<br/>PATH 3 New]
    CheckRotation3New -->|Rotated| Rotated3New[Calculate Rotated<br/>PATH 3 New]
    AxisAligned3New --> CalculateClusterData3New[Calculate Cluster Data<br/>PATH 3 New]
    Rotated3New --> CalculateClusterData3New
    CalculateClusterData3New --> SaveClusterData3New[Save Cluster Data<br/>PATH 3 New]
    SaveClusterData3New --> PlaceClusterCalc3New[Place Cluster Sleeves<br/>Using Calculated Data<br/>PATH 3 New]
    PlaceClusterCalc3New --> DeleteIndividual3New[Delete Individual Sleeves<br/>PATH 3 New]
    DeleteIndividual3New --> UpdateClusterFlags3New[Update Flags in Database<br/>PATH 3 New]
    UpdateClusterFlags3New --> ResetFlagAfterCluster
    ClusterFlow2 --> LoadClusterZones2[Load Clash Zones from DB<br/>- SleeveInstanceId > 0<br/>- IsClusterResolved = false<br/>PATH 2]
    LoadClusterZones2 --> GroupSleeves2[Group Sleeves by:<br/>- Host Type<br/>- System Type<br/>- Orientation<br/>PATH 2]
    GroupSleeves2 --> CalculateProximity2[Calculate Proximity<br/>Using Bounding Boxes<br/>PATH 2]
    CalculateProximity2 --> FormClusters2[Form Clusters<br/>Based on Join Distance<br/>PATH 2]
    FormClusters2 --> CheckRotation2{Need Rotated<br/>Bounding Box?<br/>PATH 2}
    CheckRotation2 -->|Axis-Aligned| AxisAligned2[Calculate Axis-Aligned<br/>Bounding Box<br/>PATH 2]
    CheckRotation2 -->|Rotated| Rotated2[Calculate Rotated<br/>Bounding Box<br/>PATH 2]
    AxisAligned2 --> CalculateClusterData2[Calculate Cluster Data<br/>PATH 2]
    Rotated2 --> CalculateClusterData2
    CalculateClusterData2 --> SaveClusterData2[Save Cluster Data to Database<br/>PATH 2]
    SaveClusterData2 --> PlaceCluster2[Place Cluster Sleeves<br/>Using Calculated Data<br/>PATH 2]
    PlaceCluster2 --> DeleteIndividual2[Delete Individual Sleeves<br/>within Clusters<br/>PATH 2]
    DeleteIndividual2 --> UpdateClusterFlags2[Update Flags in Database<br/>- IsClusterResolved = true<br/>- ClusterSleeveInstanceId<br/>- Clear SleeveInstanceId<br/>PATH 2]
    
    %% PATH 3: INVALIDATED ZONES - Distinct Placement Flow
    LoadConditions3 --> RunDetection3Invalidated[Run Intersection Detection<br/>for Moved MEP/Host Elements<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    RunDetection3Invalidated --> DeleteAffectedSleeves[Delete Placed Sleeves<br/>Affected by Invalid Clash Zone<br/>PATH 3]
    DeleteAffectedSleeves --> ResetFlagsDeleted[Reset Flags for Deleted Sleeves<br/>Set IsResolved = true<br/>So they won't be placed again<br/>PATH 3]
    ResetFlagsDeleted --> CalculateSize3[Calculate Sleeve Size<br/>- Read Clearance Settings from DB<br/>- Apply Clearance to MEP Dimensions<br/>PATH 3]
    CalculateSize3 --> PlaceSleeve3[Place New Sleeve<br/>With Calculated Size<br/>No Flag Check Before Placement<br/>PATH 3]
    PlaceSleeve3 --> CheckPlaceSleeve3{Sleeve<br/>Placement<br/>Success?}
    CheckPlaceSleeve3 -->|Failed| LogPlaceError3[Log Error: Sleeve Placement Failed<br/>Continue with Next Zone]
    LogPlaceError3 --> AlwaysCluster3Invalidated
    CheckPlaceSleeve3 -->|Success| UpdateFlags3[Update Flags for Placed Sleeves<br/>- IsResolved = true<br/>- SleeveInstanceId<br/>PATH 3]
    
    UpdateFlags3 --> CheckUpdateFlags3{Database<br/>Operation<br/>Success?}
    CheckUpdateFlags3 -->|Failed| LogFlagError3[Log Error: Flag Update Failed<br/>Continue with Next Zone]
    LogFlagError3 --> AlwaysCluster3Invalidated
    CheckUpdateFlags3 -->|Success| AlwaysCluster3Invalidated[Always Run Clustering<br/>Recalculation<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    AlwaysCluster3Invalidated --> ClusterFlow3Invalidated[Cluster Flow - Calculation<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated<br/>FRESH CALCULATION]
    ClusterFlow3Invalidated --> LoadClusterZones3Invalidated[Load Clash Zones from DB<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    LoadClusterZones3Invalidated --> GroupSleeves3Invalidated[Group Sleeves<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    GroupSleeves3Invalidated --> CalculateProximity3Invalidated[Calculate Proximity<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    CalculateProximity3Invalidated --> FormClusters3Invalidated[Form Clusters<br/>Based on Join Distance<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    FormClusters3Invalidated --> CheckRotation3Invalidated{Need Rotated<br/>Bounding Box?<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated}
    CheckRotation3Invalidated -->|Axis-Aligned| AxisAligned3Invalidated[Calculate Axis-Aligned<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    CheckRotation3Invalidated -->|Rotated| Rotated3Invalidated[Calculate Rotated<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    AxisAligned3Invalidated --> CalculateClusterData3Invalidated[Calculate Cluster Data<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    Rotated3Invalidated --> CalculateClusterData3Invalidated
    CalculateClusterData3Invalidated --> SaveClusterData3Invalidated[Save Cluster Data<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    SaveClusterData3Invalidated --> CheckClusterNeed3{Cluster Needed<br/>for Affected Zones?<br/>PATH 3}
    CheckClusterNeed3 -->|Cluster Not Needed| RemoveCluster3[Remove Cluster Sleeve<br/>Delete from Revit<br/>PATH 3]
    CheckClusterNeed3 -->|Cluster Needed| PlaceClusterCalc3Invalidated[Place Cluster Sleeves<br/>Using Calculated Data<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    PlaceClusterCalc3Invalidated --> DeleteIndividual3InvalidatedCluster[Delete Individual Sleeves<br/>within Clusters<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    DeleteIndividual3InvalidatedCluster --> UpdateClusterFlags3Invalidated[Update Cluster Flags<br/>- IsClusterResolved = true<br/>- ClusterSleeveInstanceId<br/>- Clear SleeveInstanceId<br/>PATH 3 Invalidated]
    RemoveCluster3 --> UpdateClusterFlags3Invalidated
    UpdateClusterFlags3Invalidated --> ResetFlagAfterCluster
    
    %% Convergence Point - ONLY After Cluster Placement and Flag Update
    %% Reset FileCombo Flag (IsFilterComboNew = 0) ONLY after:
    %% - Cluster sleeves placed (or skipped)
    %% - Cluster flags updated
    UpdateClusterFlags1 --> ResetFlagAfterCluster[Reset FileCombo Flag<br/>IsFilterComboNew = 0<br/>ONLY After:<br/>- Cluster sleeves placed<br/>- Cluster flags updated<br/>via ClashZoneRepository]
    UpdateClusterFlags2 --> ResetFlagAfterCluster
    
    ResetFlagAfterCluster --> FinalEnd([Complete])
    
    %% Styling
    classDef path1 fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#ff0000,stroke-width:2px
    classDef path2 fill:#ffe6cc,stroke:#ff8800,stroke-width:2px
    classDef path3 fill:#ccffcc,stroke:#00ff00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef database fill:#cce5ff,stroke:#0066cc,stroke-width:2px
    classDef decision fill:#ffffcc,stroke:#ffcc00,stroke-width:2px
    classDef process fill:#e6e6e6,stroke:#666666,stroke-width:1px
    classDef error fill:#ffcccc,stroke:#cc0000,stroke-width:2px,stroke-dasharray: 5 5
    
    class CheckCreateFilter,CheckSaveUIState,CheckCreateFileCombo,CheckSaveDB2,CheckCommit2,CheckSaveInvalidated,CheckCommit3,CheckLoadFilter,CheckLoadExisting1,CheckLoadConditions2,CheckLoadConditions3,CheckLoadDBSettings,CheckPlaceSleeve1,CheckPlaceSleeve2,CheckPlaceSleeve3,CheckUpdateFlags1,CheckUpdateFlags2,CheckUpdateFlags3 decision
