    class PATH2,LoadXML2,RunDetection2,SkipValidation2,CreateZones2,SaveDB2,Commit2,End2,SizingPath,LoadConditions2,CalculateSize,PlaceSleeve2,UpdateFlags2,AlwaysCluster2,ClusterFlow2,LoadClusterZones2,GroupSleeves2,CalculateProximity2,FormClusters2,CheckRotation2,AxisAligned2,Rotated2,CalculateClusterData2,SaveClusterData2,PlaceCluster2,DeleteIndividual2,UpdateClusterFlags2,CheckSaveDB2,RollbackSaveDB2,CheckCommit2,RollbackCommit2,CheckLoadConditions2,LogLoadConditionsError2,CheckPlaceSleeve2,LogPlaceError2,CheckUpdateFlags2,LogFlagError2 path2
